# ============================================================================
# Bangla Call — LOCAL secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars`.
# EVERYTHING HERE IS OPTIONAL. With nothing set, the app still runs:
#   - JWT + upload signing secrets are auto-generated and stored in KV
#   - the first person to open /admin creates the owner account (setup wizard)
#   - AI falls back to the built-in deterministic engine
#   - Telegram alerts stay off until configured in the admin panel
# Set any of these only if you want to override the zero-config defaults.
# ============================================================================

# Override the auto-generated signing secrets (optional):
# JWT_SECRET="a-long-random-string"
# UPLOAD_SIGNING_SECRET="another-long-random-string"

# Pre-seed an admin instead of using the setup wizard (optional):
# ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_USER="owner"
# ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD="change-me"

# Integrations (optional — also settable in the admin panel):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=""
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=""

# Server-side marketing (optional — also settable in the admin panel):
# META_CAPI_TOKEN=""     # Meta Conversions API access token
# GA4_API_SECRET=""      # GA4 Measurement Protocol API secret
